    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d139-a2">

                <pb facs="0210" n="134" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg134"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">His Excellency Liang
                            Shih-yi to Minister Reinsch
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-04-05">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 5, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: I have the honor to inform you that
                    the purpose to which the short term loan now to be issued by the firm of Messrs.
                    Lee, Higginson &amp; Company, American fiscal agents of the Chinese Government,
                    is to be devoted is as follows:</p>
                <p>Advances to the Provinces for industrial developments, municipal improvements,
                    and education: all under the budget for 1916.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Liang Shih-yi</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
